 저만의 비결이죠.","source_cn":"呵呵……这是我秘不传人的诀窍。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1B089C3A448004","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하하... 저만의 비결이죠.","female":"하하... 저만의 비결이죠.","variant_male_record_index":"184110","variant_female_record_index":"184111","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520327004:1":{"text":"과르, 이제 아쿠보르인이 나무 위에 집을 짓는데 집착하는 이유를 알겠느냐?","source_cn":"果，你知道为何雅库伯尔人执着于将房屋建在树上吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C8B5E297E04F16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520327005:1":{"text":"어... 풍경을 보기 위해서인가요? 여기서 바라보는 풍경이 끝내줬어요!","source_cn":"呃……为了看风景？这上面的风景不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD49F73A2FAC6B1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520327006:0":{"text":"...진지하게 답하려무나!","source_cn":"……你给我认真一点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA7A6D600080C737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520327007:0":{"text":"네? 그럼... 혹시 낙엽초를 훔쳤을 때, 허니리프베어한테 쫓기지 않기 위해서인가요?","source_cn":"啊？那……那难道是为了偷叶子的时候不被叶角熊追上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC28E59FA26DAF0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520327008:0":{"text":"그것밖에 생각이 안 나느냐!","source_cn":"狭隘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EBF52ACBE1BE058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1520327009:0":{"text":"높은 곳에 집을 짓는 이유는 짐승의 습격을 피하고, 짐승과의 싸움에서 주도권을 확보하기 위함이다!","source_cn":"把房屋建在高处，是为了躲避野兽的侵袭，还能帮我们在与野...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA759ED21A9F9254D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520327010:0":{"text":"그렇기에 아쿠보르에 “나무집을 지어야만 성인으로 인정받을 수 있다.”라는 풍습이 생긴 것이지.","source_cn":"也是因此，雅库伯尔才会有“建造树屋后才算正式成年”的习俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x637D7777D430677D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520327011:0":{"text":"너희들처럼 갓 성인이 된 아이들뿐만 아니라, 모든 아쿠보르인들은 나무집에 의지하여 살아가야 한단다. 알겠느냐?","source_cn":"不仅是你们这些刚成年的孩子们，每一个雅库伯尔人都要依靠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF22EEBEDA4DAD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520327012:1":{"text":"그렇군요! 이제 알겠어요!","source_cn":"原来是这样！我现在明白了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB30F5EA4BF29FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1520327013:0":{"text":"에휴... 왜 가면 갈수록 아이들이 겁이 많아지는 건지 모르겠구나... 나무 하나도 제대로 못 오르다니...","source_cn":"唉……真是搞不明白，为什么新一代的孩子里，胆小的越来越...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE71FBE287C6F966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1520327014:1":{"text":"과르, 이제 됐다. 풍경 구경은 그만하고 빨리 내려오거라.","source_cn":"好了。果，快点下来，别在上面看风景了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD54837A1D15BFC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1520327015:1":{"text":"네? 내려가라고요? 내려가기도 해야 하나요?!","source_cn":"啊？下去？还要下去吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72954D7932367703","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1520327016:1":{"text":"설마 그 위에서 평생 살 생각이냐? 빨리 내려오너라.","source_cn":"难不成你要在上面呆一辈子？快点下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1C1D8B123D6792C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1520327017:1":{"text":"저... 저는... ","source_cn":"我……我……<key:dialog56>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81E3021E20FF0547","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1520327018:0":{"text":"...못 내려가겠어요!!","source_cn":"……我不敢啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B648052F7FCC6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1520327019:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog117>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A1F9517B600F1F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1520327020:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog118>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x540DAE2BFBC19700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1520327021:0":{"text":"...그럼 평생 그 위에서 살거라!","source_cn":"……那你就在上面待着吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B6403C65AA7AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1520327022:0":{"text":"잠깐만요! 듀로 님, 가지 마세요! 듀로 님! 살려주세요!","source_cn":"哎哎哎！都罗，你别走啊！都罗——！救命——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FD2C699FBE3D159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"역시 네가 꾸민 일이었구나","source_cn":"果然是你的主意","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC68FE95C3E27E7DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역시 네가 꾸민 일이었구나","female":"역시 네가 꾸민 일이었구나","variant_male_record_index":"78259","variant_female_record_index":"78260","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_